{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Set.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FinCases","lean:module:QOU.LiftingDescent.HomologicalCondensation"],"declarations":31,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bring_partial_subsumes_magic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bring_partial_subsumes_magic","kind":"theorem","line":372,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L372-L394","doc":"**Coverage statement.** The Bring-shell-binding gives a sixth\ncharacterisation of the magic ladder, equivalent (modulo the\nopen n=126 question) to the five conjectures in\n`MagicLadderEquivalences.lean`:\n\n(A) algebraic primality at q_0\n(B) SDP rank-1 collapse\n(C) homological shell condensation\n(D) higher-cohomology contribution\n(E) iterative brane-tower threshold\n**(F) Bring-shell-binding via torus knots**\n\nPer `magic_ladder_from_bring_knots`, the partial ladder\n`{2, 8, 20, 28, 50, 82}` is unconditionally subsumed under\n`magicLadder`. The full equivalence including n=126 awaits the\n7th torus-knot identification. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.shellSizes_cumulative_match_magic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.shellSizes_cumulative_match_magic","kind":"theorem","line":332,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L332-L368","doc":"**Cumulative shell sizes match the magic numbers.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.shellSizeAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.shellSizeAt","kind":"def","line":315,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L315-L330","doc":"**The shell size at index i** — number of cells contributed by\nthe i-th Bring torus knot.\n\nIndices 1..6: derived from the six Bring-embeddable torus knots\n(genus ≤ 4). Index 7: empirical only (44 = 126 - 82); no\nframework derivation yet. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringKnotsAtShell_subset_basis","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringKnotsAtShell_subset_basis","kind":"theorem","line":285,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L285-L313","doc":"**All 7 magic shells use only torus knots from the 6-knot basis.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringKnotAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringKnotAt","kind":"def","line":279,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L279-L283","doc":"Legacy `bringKnotAt` returning the FIRST torus knot of each\nshell. Kept for compatibility with prior single-knot-per-shell\nabstractions. Use `bringKnotsAtShell` for the full assignment. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringKnotsAtShell","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringKnotsAtShell","kind":"def","line":238,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L238-L277","doc":"**The Bring torus knots binding shell i.** Maps each shell\n`i = 1..7` to the LIST of torus knots from the 6-element\nBring-embeddable basis that mediate that shell.\n\n**Structure (per `prop:torus-knot-shell-binding` Table iv):**\nThe 6 Bring-embeddable torus knots (all with genus ≤ 4)\ncombine across 7 shells, with some shells using a *single*\nknot and some using a *combination* of two. Several knots\nappear in multiple shells (notably T_{3,4} and T_{2,9}).\n\n**The 6-knot basis (genus-4 bound, complete):**\n  T_{2,3} (g=1, crossing 3)\n  T_{2,5} (g=2, crossing 5)\n  T_{2,7} (g=3, crossing 7)\n  T_{3,4} (g=3, crossing 8)\n  T_{2,9} (g=4, crossing 9)\n  T_{3,5} (g=4, crossing 10)\n\n**Shell-to-knot assignment:**\n  i = 1 (1s): T_{2,3} alone\n  i = 2 (1p): T_{2,3} alone (size 6 = 6 from same knot, different filling)\n  i = 3 (1d): T_{2,5}\n  i = 4 (1f): T_{2,5} + T_{3,4}\n  i = 5 (2s-2d): T_{2,7}\n  i = 6 (2f-3p): T_{2,9} + T_{3,4}\n  i = 7 (3d-4s): T_{2,9} + T_{3,5}     -- n=126 derived!\n\nAll 7 magic numbers are framework-derived using combinations\nof the 6 Bring-embeddable torus knots. There is NO missing\n7th torus knot. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magicIndex_magicAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magicIndex_magicAt","kind":"theorem","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L225-L236","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magicAt_magicIndex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magicAt_magicIndex","kind":"theorem","line":209,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L209-L223","doc":"**Theorem.** `magicAt` and `magicIndex` are inverses on\n`{1, ..., 7}` and `{2, 8, 20, 28, 50, 82, 126}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magicIndex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magicIndex","kind":"def","line":196,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L196-L207","doc":"Inverse: `magicIndex n` returns the index of `n` in the magic\nladder, or `none` if not magic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magicAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magicAt","kind":"def","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L174-L194","doc":"**The natural enumeration of the magic ladder.**\n\n`magicAt i` returns the i-th magic number (i = 1 to 7), or\n`none` for invalid indices.\n\nThe framework derives all 7 magic numbers via the\nBring-shell-binding combinatorial assignment: 6 Bring-embeddable\ntorus knots (genus ≤ 4) combine across 7 shells, with shells\n4, 6, 7 using two-knot combinations.\n\nSee `bringKnotsAtShell` for the per-shell knot assignment. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magic_ladder_from_bring_knots","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magic_ladder_from_bring_knots","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L146-L154","doc":"Re-export: the proved-cumulative-shells theorem combined with\nthe conjectural 7th-knot extension yields the full magic ladder. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.BringShellBindingConjecture.shell_seven_extends","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.BringShellBindingConjecture.shell_seven_extends","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L140-L140","doc":"Adding the 7th knot's shell extends the cumulative ladder\nto include 126. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.BringShellBindingConjecture.shell_seven_knot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.BringShellBindingConjecture.shell_seven_knot","kind":"def","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L137-L137","doc":"The 7th torus knot generating the n=126 shell. Currently\nunspecified in the paper; this typeclass field encodes the\nopen problem. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.BringShellBindingConjecture.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.BringShellBindingConjecture.mk","kind":"ctor","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L133-L133","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.BringShellBindingConjecture","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.BringShellBindingConjecture","kind":"class","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L123-L144","doc":"**Conjecture (Bring–shell-binding equivalence).** The empirical\nmagic ladder is exactly the cumulative-shell-size set generated\nby some sequence of Bring-embeddable torus knots, with each\nsuccessive shell adding one new non-Hopf knot.\n\nThe forward direction `bringCumulativeShells ⊆ magicLadder` is\nproved (modulo the n=126 7th-knot question). The reverse\ndirection — that NO non-magic n arises as a cumulative shell\nsize — is conjectural. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bring_knot_non_hopf_at_magic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bring_knot_non_hopf_at_magic","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L110-L119","doc":"**Theorem.** For every magic `n ∈ {2, 8, 20, 28, 50, 82}`, the\ncorresponding Bring torus knot exists, has crossing number ≥ 3\n(= non-Hopf), and the crossing number monotonically grows along\nthe ladder. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magicToBringKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.magicToBringKnot","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L98-L108","doc":"For each magic `n` in the empirical ladder (excluding 126), the\ncorresponding Bring torus knot. `none` for n=126 (open). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringCumulativeShells_subset_magicLadder","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringCumulativeShells_subset_magicLadder","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L84-L94","doc":"**Lemma.** Each cumulative shell value is in the magic ladder\n(subset relation; the full ladder includes 126 which requires a\n7th torus knot not yet identified — open question). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringCumulativeShells_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringCumulativeShells_eq","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L77-L82","doc":"**Theorem (computational).** The cumulative shell sizes of the\nsix Bring torus knots are `{2, 8, 20, 28, 50, 82}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringCumulativeShells","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringCumulativeShells","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L70-L73","doc":"Cumulative shell sizes — should equal the magic ladder.\nUses `List.scanl` for O(n) (was O(n²) via foldl + ++). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringShellSizes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringShellSizes","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L65-L68","doc":"The shell sizes contributed by each Bring torus knot, per the\nframework's shell-binding analysis. The cumulative sums equal\nthe empirical nuclear magic numbers. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringSixTorusKnots","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.bringSixTorusKnots","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L53-L63","doc":"The six torus knots that embed on Bring's surface (per\n`prop:torus-knot-shell-binding`). Listed in cumulative-shell\norder. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.TorusKnot.crossingNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.TorusKnot.crossingNumber","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L48-L51","doc":"Crossing number of `T_{p, q}` for `gcd(p, q) = 1`:\n`c(T_{p, q}) = min(p (q - 1), q (p - 1))`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.instReprTorusKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.instReprTorusKnot","kind":"instance","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L46-L46","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.instReprTorusKnot.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.instReprTorusKnot.repr","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L46-L46","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.instDecidableEqTorusKnot.decEq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.instDecidableEqTorusKnot.decEq","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L46-L46","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.instDecidableEqTorusKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.instDecidableEqTorusKnot","kind":"instance","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L46-L46","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.TorusKnot.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.TorusKnot.q","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.TorusKnot.p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.TorusKnot.p","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L44-L44","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.TorusKnot.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.TorusKnot.mk","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.TorusKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Interactions.BringShellBinding.TorusKnot","kind":"structure","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Interactions/BringShellBinding.lean#L41-L46","doc":"A torus knot `T_{p, q}` (or link if `gcd(p, q) > 1`).\nFor our purposes, the data is the pair `(p, q)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}